Thank you for your sharing your resume for this=20
    work at home Job Alert! We are a medical transcription company=2E

After=20
    reviewing your resume we are interested=2E

Transam Associates provides=20
    precise medical transcription of voice files that doctors dictate for=20
    hospitals, clinics and doctor offices=2E

Transam Associates also=20
    conducts its own training program that prepares individuals for the =
medical=20
    transcription profession. This training is done online in the comfort =
of=20
    your own home. A personal trainer is provided to guide individuals in =
the=20
    training program through a Live Chat environment=2E

As a recruiter for=20
    this national transcription service, I am seeking full-and part-time,=20
    home-based medical transcriptionists. We are committed to providing a =
work=20
    environment where medical transcriptionists can grow and be respected =
for=20
    the professionals they are=2E

This is an entry level opportunity and if=20
    you are not yet qualified, we'll provide tuition FREE training and a=20
    personal trainer that you'll need to become qualified. Once you meet =
our=20
    criteria, which will be defined for you before you begin, you will be=20
    certified by us as an accomplished medical transcriptionist and can =
begin to=20
    work for Transam Associates, Inc.=20

The pay is good. After completing=20
    the training program, people seem to do quite well and as you get =
more=20
    experience, people seem to earn $1,000 to $2,000 a month working about =
20-30=20
    hours a week. Some make $3,000-$4,000 a month, full-time 40-48 hours a =
week=20
    (This does not happen overnight). If you want to work more, you'll =
earn=20
    more. If you want to work less, you'll earn less. The choice is =
yours.=20
   =20

We will provide to you a great working environment where you can=20
    make a difference. Our medical transcriptionists start as contractors =
and=20
    are eligible for raises. Whether or not you have experience, you can =
find=20
    rewarding work as a medical transcriptionist=2E

If you are interested=20
    in a job interview please email: transamassociates-H+0wwilmMs3R7s880joybQ@public.gmane.org =20

We are looking=20
    forward to working with you=2E

Thank you!=20
   =20
